      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779395127427,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Entonces el código C queda como:\n\nC : {(c1,c2,...,c8) en {0,1} : c1 = c5+c7 ^ c2 = c5+c6+c7+c8 ^ c3 = c7+c8 ^ c4 = c5+c6}\nC : {(c5+c7,c5+c6+c7+c8,c7+c8,c5+c6,c5,...,c8) : c5,c6,c7,c8 en {0,1}}\nC : {c5(1,1,0,1,1,0,0,0) + c6(0,1,0,1,0,1,0,0) + c7(1,1,1,0,0,0,1,0) + c8(0,1,1,0,0,0,0,1) : c5,c6,c7,c8 en {0,1}}",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Entonces el código C queda como:\n\nC : {(c1,c2,...,c8) en {0,1} : c1 = c5+c7 ^ c2 = c5+c6+c7+c8 ^ c3 = c7+c8 ^ c4 = c5+c6}\nC : {(c5+c7,c5+c6+c7+c8,c7+c8,c5+c6,c5,...,c8) : c5,c6,c7,c8 en {0,1}}\nC : {c5(1,1,0,1,1,0,0,0) + c6(0,1,0,1,0,1,0,0) + c7(1,1,1,0,0,0,1,0) + c8(0,1,1,0,0,0,0,1) : c5,c6,c7,c8 en {0,1}}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7nx547YP3GIM7J9knwX0P",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1433.8818837556128,
      "y": 1006.9376218700223,
      "width": 237.60000610351562,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
